{"id":"n47384-3-5","stage":1,"title":"더럽다 · 坏","scene":"居住与环境","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n47384-3-5-1","ko":"내가 치사하고 더러워서 회사를 그만 둬야지, 원.","zh":"公司里这些卑鄙龌龊的事，我实在受不了了，得辞职才行。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"내가","meaning":"我","explanation":"나：我；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"나","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60931","senseId":"1","lemma":"나","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"내가","audio":"/audio/7ee3e480d2ca3192b2bc.mp3"}},{"text":"치사하고","meaning":"卑鄙、小气、令人不齿","explanation":"치사하다：卑鄙、小气、令人不齿；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"치사하다","audio":"/audio/213c0f7d96472ab43283.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"course:치사하다:1","senseId":"1","lemma":"치사하다","origin":"course-authored supplement"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"치사하고","audio":"/audio/ef41fbd9ce37bb3e37f9.mp3"}},{"text":"더러워서","meaning":"坏，卑鄙，肮脏","explanation":"더럽다：坏，卑鄙，肮脏；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"더럽다","audio":"/audio/af422da88e6c5a06f998.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"47384","senseId":"3","lemma":"더럽다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"더러워서","audio":"/audio/b119c91332762e030016.mp3"}},{"text":"회사를","meaning":"公司，企业，会社","explanation":"회사：公司，企业，会社；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"회사","audio":"/audio/a109dcd7f6f11c2e1703.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"31668","senseId":"1","lemma":"회사","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"회사를","audio":"/audio/62f80adf2dcac5e0aace.mp3"}},{"text":"그만","meaning":"不得不，无可奈何","explanation":"그만：不得不，无可奈何","readings":[{"term":"그만","audio":"/audio/38c09c96aa077d2721fe.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"36428","senseId":"5","lemma":"그만","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"그만","audio":"/audio/38c09c96aa077d2721fe.mp3"}},{"text":"둬야지,","meaning":"放任，撇下，搁置","explanation":"두다：放任，撇下，搁置；어야지：表示必要条件或应当如此，再接后面的判断。","readings":[{"term":"두다","audio":"/audio/531b2c3977c491e8379e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67470","senseId":"16","lemma":"두다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"둬야지","audio":"/audio/b55af6c628615870e8ee.mp3"}},{"text":"원.","meaning":"噢","explanation":"원：噢","readings":[{"term":"원","audio":"/audio/c19fd6787279897c79a8.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69828","senseId":"1","lemma":"원","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"원","audio":"/audio/c19fd6787279897c79a8.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"1098bbe54520ab2a","term":"나","zh":"我","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3","entryId":"60931","definition":"说话人在朋友或晚辈面前用来指称自己。","pronunciation":["나"]},{"id":"213c0f7d96472ab4","term":"치사하다","zh":"卑鄙、小气、令人不齿","audio":"/audio/213c0f7d96472ab43283.mp3","definition":"言行或处事不光明磊落，让人觉得卑鄙或小气；与“致死、致谢”等同形动词不同。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"af422da88e6c5a06","term":"더럽다","zh":"坏，卑鄙，肮脏","audio":"/audio/af422da88e6c5a06f998.mp3","entryId":"47384","definition":"别人的话或行动非常不顺眼而觉得可耻。","pronunciation":["더ː럽따"]},{"id":"a109dcd7f6f11c2e","term":"회사","zh":"公司，企业，会社","audio":"/audio/a109dcd7f6f11c2e1703.mp3","entryId":"31668","definition":"想要通过事业获得利益的许多人一起建立的法人团体。","pronunciation":["회ː사","훼ː사"]},{"id":"38c09c96aa077d27","term":"그만","zh":"不得不，无可奈何","audio":"/audio/38c09c96aa077d2721fe.mp3","entryId":"36428","definition":"没有别的方法就。","pronunciation":["그만"]},{"id":"531b2c3977c491e8","term":"두다","zh":"放任，撇下，搁置","audio":"/audio/531b2c3977c491e8379e.mp3","entryId":"67470","definition":"不做某事而往后推迟。","pronunciation":["두다"]},{"id":"c19fd6787279897c","term":"원","zh":"噢","audio":"/audio/c19fd6787279897c79a8.mp3","entryId":"69828","definition":"因没预料到的事情而感到惊讶或不愉快时发出的声音。","pronunciation":["원"]}],"audio":"/audio/1bc11a6566e92141c50c.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n47384-3-5-2","ko":"왜 그래? 회사에서 무슨 일 있었어?","zh":"怎么了？公司里发生什么事了？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"왜","meaning":"为什么","explanation":"왜：为什么","readings":[{"term":"왜","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67848","sen